[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_1CO_C22_C07_TICKET_FINE]
Great Exhibition · Steam Engine Venue · Ticket Fine

[l_english.INVENTORY_ITEM_1CO_C22_C07_TICKET_FINE_DESC]
You have been fined at the Steam Engine Venue of the The Great Exhibition of Jahr Null.
According to the regulations of the Las Pegasus Consortium, entering the steam engine venue requires a separate ticket. You did not purchase a ticket or make any purchases, so you were fined. Because the Las Pegasus Consortium respects the fun of visitors, we did not charge you directly for this fee, but deducted it directly from your account.
Please pay the fine as soon as possible, otherwise more overdue fines will be automatically deducted from your account.

